    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1">

                <pb facs="0099" n="1" sameAs="frus:frus1920v01/pg1"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72110/8937: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Davis</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-02-06T20:00:00+00:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 6,
                                1920—8 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 9:47 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>205. Should I attend prospective meeting of Premiers in London if invited and, if
                    so, under what instructions?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
